| `#1E40AF` | [manifest.ts](file:///c:/Users/prac.almacenamiento/OneDrive%20-%20Prebel%20S.A%20BIC/Escritorio/Alex_Py/SIGIM/FRONT_FormContainers/src/app/manifest.ts#L14-L15), [head.tsx](file:///c:/Users/prac.almacenamiento/OneDrive%20-%20Prebel%20S.A%20BIC/Escritorio/Alex_Py/SIGIM/FRONT_FormContainers/src/app/head.tsx#L5) | PWA `theme_color` y `background_color` (azul oscuro Tailwind `blue-800`) |

